WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:05.792
Voice Tuner is the safe testing lab.
Option A is the current live

2
00:00:05.792 --> 00:00:09.584
voice. Option B is the sandbox version.
Nothing changes live unless

3
00:00:09.584 --> 00:00:13.376
you explicitly apply it live.

4
00:00:13.376 --> 00:00:17.432
Choose the voice, choose the format, run
the A B test, then add

5
00:00:17.432 --> 00:00:22.908
feedback to the sandbox until the voice
feels right.
